  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 雨\ntitle: rain\njlpt: 5\ntags: [jlpt-n5, grade-1, pictograph, starter]\nstrokes: 8\nradical: 雨\nradicalNumber: 173\nonyomi: [ウ]\nkunyomi: [あめ, あま-, -さめ]\ndistractors: [電, 西, 山]\n---\n\n# 雨 — rain\n\n**Strokes:** 8 · **Key (radical):** 雨 (no. 173) · **JLPT:** N5 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n雨 is a pictograph: the top line is the sky, the frame 冂 is a cloud, and the four dots are drops falling from it. The form was squared off over time.\nAs a radical it forms weather words: [電](電.md) (lightning, electricity), 雪 (snow), 雲 (cloud) and 雷 (thunder).\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ウ | on | 雨天 うてん, 豪雨 ごうう, 梅雨 ばいう／つゆ (special) |\n| あめ | kun | [雨](../words/雨.md) あめ, 雨の日 あめのひ, 大雨 おおあめ |\n| あま- | kun | 雨傘 あまがさ, [雨戸](../words/雨戸.md) あまど, 雨水 あまみず |\n| -さめ | kun | 小雨 こさめ, 春雨 はるさめ (voiced from あめ) |\n\nSpecial reading: 梅雨 is つゆ (rainy season), and also ばいう in the on reading.\n\n## Common words\n\n- [雨](../words/雨.md) あめ — rain\n- 大雨 おおあめ — heavy rain\n- 雨具 あまぐ — rain gear\n\n## Notes\n\nCompare 両 (りょう, both): 雨 has a roof line with four dots and a hook; 両 has no dots.\n雨 is the top of 電 (lightning, electricity), 雪, 雲, 雷 — useful for spotting weather vocabulary.\n",
